msgstr ""
"No llama a la API: el pedido se escribe en ~/.config/sumi-contract/ai/"
"request.json y la respuesta se lee de reply.json en esa carpeta."

#: Config.class:62
msgid "Log level"
msgstr "Nivel del registro"

#: Config.class:62
msgid ""
"How much sumi-contract writes to its log (~/.config/sumi-contract/logs, one "
"file per day, the last 7 kept). Warnings and errors are always written."
